    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/b89b614ac473f55a7efd59935997def3.poster.avif?t=1740056730\" width=800 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/b89b614ac473f55a7efd59935997def3.webm?t=1740056730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/b89b614ac473f55a7efd59935997def3.mp4?t=1740056730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/3b053ce689744d308124ab2607a7e25c.poster.avif?t=1740056730\" width=800 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/3b053ce689744d308124ab2607a7e25c.webm?t=1740056730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/3b053ce689744d308124ab2607a7e25c.mp4?t=1740056730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/fe8a41d82f380fc974c89e27672b2639.poster.avif?t=1740056730\" width=800 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/fe8a41d82f380fc974c89e27672b2639.webm?t=1740056730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/fe8a41d82f380fc974c89e27672b2639.mp4?t=1740056730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Embark on your own journey through the atmospheric ruined kingdom and uncover its secrets and stories.<br><br>Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your wheeled hero</strong>: Five distinct character types to pick from, each with plenty of visual customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the kingdom your way</strong>: Follow your own path and see where it takes you\u2014you never know what surprises you might stumble across.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your village and yourself</strong>: Build your cave village through 5 levels of progress for the greater good, or embrace 5 levels of dark, self-serving power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face creepy foes and meet friendly faces</strong>: Encounter wheeled monsters of all kinds, but also meet characters with their own stories to tell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the lore at your own pace</strong>: The Wheelborn world is rich with history and secrets, waiting for you to uncover them in any order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted nostalgic visuals</strong>: Experience a lovingly crafted world with 2004-style graphics, full of detail and charm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/01db63c941279c3463c39a22c9dc9b31.poster.avif?t=1740056730\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/01db63c941279c3463c39a22c9dc9b31.webm?t=1740056730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704210/extras/01db63c941279c3463c39a22c9dc9b31.mp4?t=1740056730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
